"sha256:63081b413aa88c055094578a761b7a4504a17a9a8f9a2512fdc47547c0f762e5","download_count":1,"created_at":"2026-09-15T11:38:51Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T11:38:51Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/mekhovov/revealline/releases/download/v0.57.0/verification.json"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/tarball/v0.57.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mekhovov/revealline/zipball/v0.57.0","body":"# P01 — Visible loading and recovery\n\nStarting a flight, downloading content and opening tools now show immediate game-styled feedback. Progress is measured where available, with appropriate Cancel, Stop waiting and Retry actions.\n\n- Covers 56 inventoried entry points across boot, Solo, Couch, offline preparation, saves/recovery, media and Asset Studio.\n- Keeps loading messages and escape actions visible on portrait phones and short landscape screens.\n- Preserves saved artwork, explicit Resume, save ownership and protection against late results from abandoned screens.\n- Adds real service-worker preparation progress and updates production recipes, documentation, skills and AI prompts.\n\nExact game source: `b7db0134d4ede3452dc90b5d3f7ffb1491a0579b`.\n\nAll six local gates and both hosted source suites pass: 4,185/4,185 tests, zero failures, skips, cancellations or todo. Production reproduction/readiness and ordinary build pass. The original frozen source archive matches all 4,382 Git files; every one of the 654 game files matches its manifest. Attached qualification and evidence preserve prior failures, corrections and browser-test limits.\n\nGitHub Pages deployment and public byte/play/offline verification are pending. P01 acceptance will be recorded after those checks; later sound, mode-entry and map-parity phases remain separate. Desktop browser and modeled-input checks do not certify physical devices.\n"}